essibility fix\n- Stage the modified test file\n- Create descriptive commit message following project conventions\n- Complete the implementation cycle for issue #3\n\n## Validation\nExecute every command to validate the patch is complete with zero regressions.\n\n1. `grep -A 5 -B 5 \"aria-label\" web-components/test/sidenav/catalog-sidenav.test.html` - Verify aria-label implementation\n2. `grep -A 5 -B 5 \"target=\\\"_blank\\\"\" web-components/test/sidenav/catalog-sidenav.test.html` - Verify target blank implementation\n3. `git status` - Confirm clean working directory after commit\n4. `git log --oneline -1` - Verify commit message and completion\n5. Review HTML structure around lines 96-104 for proper accessibility attributes\n\n## Patch Scope\n**Lines of code to change:** 0 (implementation complete, just needs commit)\n**Risk level:** low\n**Testing required:** Accessibility validation and HTML structure verification"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mas8hgxZFTdMsPzqBmy9da"}}
